lake-builder is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE). The source code uses only the Python
standard library and has no third-party Python package. The container image built from the
Dockerfile is scratch plus the components below, each under its own license.
From: docs/builder/image.md, which lists every file in the image; tools/image-files.py checks a
built image against that list, and tools/sbom.py writes the same components into the SBOM.
Each license text is at the component's source, given below.

