The libseccomp exception

buildkit-runc is the upstream BuildKit release binary of runc. It links libseccomp 2.6.0
(LGPL-2.1-only) statically so that untrusted Dockerfile RUN steps run under a seccomp filter.
libseccomp's source is at https://github.com/seccomp/libseccomp/tree/v2.6.0, and the build that
links it is the runc stage of https://github.com/moby/buildkit/blob/v0.33.0/Dockerfile, which
uses runc's vendored Go source (Apache-2.0). A recipient can rebuild runc against a modified
libseccomp with that stage, as LGPL-2.1 section 6 allows. It is the one LGPL component in the
image; the image holds no GPL code.
